{"id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-formula.md","title":"有签名的一阶项与公式","display":"df-formula — 有签名的一阶项与公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-formula","aliases":["20-df-formula"],"display":"df-formula — 有签名的一阶项与公式","chapter":"10","section":"10.1","source_kind":"local-formalization","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§10.1 可计算语言和 Gödel 编码；本地语法展开","source_pdf_pages":[215],"source_printed_pages":[183],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula — 有签名的一阶项与公式"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§10.1 可计算语言和 Gödel 编码；本地语法展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>183</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,R\">\\(F,R\\)</span> 为互不交的可计算符号集，元数映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F,a_R:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(a_F,a_R:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 在各自定义域可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span> 与它们不交。有限语法树用带标签的有限序列编码。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{T:\n\\mathrm{Var}\\subseteq T\\land\n\\forall f\\in F\\ \\forall(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\in T^{a_F(f)}\\\n[(f,(t_i))\\in T]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L):=\n\\{(=,t,u):t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\cup\\{(r,(t_i)):r\\in R,\\ (t_i)\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)^{a_R(r)}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{S:\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq S\\land\n\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in S\\ \\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\\n[(\\neg,\\phi),(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),(\\forall,v,\\phi)\\in S]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{T:\n\\mathrm{Var}\\subseteq T\\land\n\\forall f\\in F\\ \\forall(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\in T^{a_F(f)}\\\n[(f,(t_i))\\in T]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L):=\n\\{(=,t,u):t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\cup\\{(r,(t_i)):r\\in R,\\ (t_i)\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)^{a_R(r)}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{S:\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq S\\land\n\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in S\\ \\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\\n[(\\neg,\\phi),(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),(\\forall,v,\\phi)\\in S]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有候选 T、S 均限制在有限带标签语法树的集合内，避免交集取于真类。变量是叶子；0 元函数符号是常量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land,\\lor,\\exists\">\\(\\land,\\lor,\\exists\\)</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\to,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\to,\\forall\\)</span> 的明确经典缩写，句子指没有自由变量的公式。替换按有限语法树递归并重命名冲突的约束变量；自由变量也逐构造子递归计算。原 Form=Cl(Atom,...) 未定义闭包，已完整展开。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1 可计算语言和 Gödel 编码；本地语法展开；印刷页 183；PDF 第 215 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)","display":false},{"tex":"F,R","display":false},{"tex":"a_F,a_R:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{T:\n\\mathrm{Var}\\subseteq T\\land\n\\forall f\\in F\\ \\forall(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)}\\in T^{a_F(f)}\\\n[(f,(t_i))\\in T]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L):=\n\\{(=,t,u):t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\cup\\{(r,(t_i)):r\\in R,\\ (t_i)\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)^{a_R(r)}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{S:\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq S\\land\n\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in S\\ \\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\\n[(\\neg,\\phi),(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),(\\forall,v,\\phi)\\in S]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\land,\\lor,\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\to,\\forall","display":false}],"bytes":1994,"backlinks":[{"id":"67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。"},{"id":"8372bbf882660759","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]。"},{"id":"2772d51949360c14","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-provable]]。"},{"id":"ea674d0eb2839a85","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]。"},{"id":"d4a7833057f5a20e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]。"},{"id":"a6a902146de6a471","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]。"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435"]}